# GameLens (lens)

- Schema truth: `docs/adr/ADR-0009-gamelens-snapshot.md` + operator guide `docs/gamelens.md`.
- Manifest `schema_version: 1`: game declares WHAT (QL-5); Questline serializes/diffs HOW.
- Diff kinds stay first-class: `changed`, `added_entity`, `removed_entity`, curve/series.
- CLI human text: **ASCII-only** (Windows cp1252 — INC-0007). No Unicode arrows/delta in echo paths.
- `--store FILE` → artifacts at `FILE.parent/artifacts/lens/<id>/` (not always `.questline/artifacts`).
- AI implications remain stub/`pending phase-11` until LLMPort exists — never fake a live report.
- No ElJuegaso/P1 type names in lens core; fixtures stay generic.
